    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anthill Village</strong> is a cosy, creative strategy game where you build villages for thousands of ant-inspired creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Building with a Twist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antlings</strong> have all the strengths of both ants and people! They can craft tools and build villages - while also cooperating on a massive scale thanks to their hive-mind intelligence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of village-building and tactical gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the land, using all resources you can find to further the colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your ants down many different paths to suit a range of different habitats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research ant-inspired technologies from aphid farming to leaf-cutting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off predatory animals - until you can become the apex predator yourself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the YouTube channel or Discord server to follow along with development.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anthill Village</strong> is a cosy, creative strategy game where you build villages for thousands of ant-inspired creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Building with a Twist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Antlings</strong> have all the strengths of both ants and people! They can craft tools and build villages - while also cooperating on a massive scale thanks to their hive-mind intelligence.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique blend of village-building and tactical gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the land, using all resources you can find to further the colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your ants down many different paths to suit a range of different habitats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research ant-inspired technologies from aphid farming to leaf-cutting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off predatory animals - until you can become the apex predator yourself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the YouTube channel or Discord server to follow along with development.</p>",
    "short_description": "Now that ants have evolved thumbs, they're unstoppable! Help them build villages, scour the land for resources and fend off creatures 100 times their size!",
